    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cyprius Vīcus</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a street in Rome</i>:
			a cypro, quod ibi Sabini cives additi consederunt, qui a bono omine
			id appellarunt; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nam cyprum Sabine bonum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 159</span></i>
			 Müll.; cf. <i><span class="en">Liv. 1, 48, 6</span></i>.</div>
